      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Product ad in one click\n\nType a **one-line brief**. The LLM writes an image prompt and a motion prompt, **Seedream 5.0 Pro** makes the 16:9 hero shot, **Seedance 2.0** animates it, and **vCube** upscales and cleans the clip to 1080p.\n\nvCube takes the clip as a link (the Seedance response), so no Comfy.org login is needed. Needs a ModelArk key and a MediaKit key in Settings > BytePlus."
      ],
